# ── Secrets: NEVER commit / push ──
# Sparkle EdDSA signing PRIVATE KEY (release-signing secret). Authoritative copy lives in the
# login Keychain; the file here is only a convenience backup. Bare name → matches in any dir.
sparkle_private_key.txt
*.private_key
*.private.key
